HOSTPULSE loader.\nUsage\n(venv) $$> python ghostpulse_payload_extractor.py -h\nusage: GHOSTPULSE payload extractor [-h] (-f FILE | -d DIRECTORY) -o OUTDIR\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  -f FILE, --file FILE  GHOST"]
